OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FRain persists across far
OL,6,Fnorthern Scotland, while showers
OL,7,Fdevelop widely across Northern
OL,8,FIreland, Scotland and northern
OL,9,FEngland, these will become slow-moving
OL,10,Fand thundery in places. Elsewhere, dry
OL,11,Fwith sunny spells. Windy in the north,
OL,12,Fespecially around exposed coasts.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FShowers or longer spells of
OL,15,Frain continue across northern areas,
OL,16,Fgradually clearing eastwards
OL,17,Fovernight. Dry elsewhere with clear
OL,18,Fspells. Much cooler than recent nights.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
