OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FDrier on Thursday, with
OL,6,Fsunny or bright spells developing
OL,7,Fdespite a fair amount of cloud. A few
OL,8,Fisolated showers persist. Cooler than
OL,9,Frecent days, with temperatures close
OL,10,Fto average.
